<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Renato Montagnoli Robles | Portfólio</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-color: #f8fafc;
      --surface-color: #ffffff;
      --text-main: #0f172a;
      --text-muted: #475569;
      --primary: #1d4ed8;
      --primary-light: #eff6ff;
      --border-color: #e2e8f0;
      --shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05), 0 2px 4px -2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
      --radius: 12px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg-color);
      color: var(--text-main);
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 840px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    /* Cabeçalho */
    header {
      background-color: var(--surface-color);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      padding: 48px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: var(--primary-light);
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--text-main);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .institution {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .bio {
      max-width: 540px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-style: italic;
      padding-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    }

    /* Conteúdo Principal */
    main {
      padding: 48px 0;
    }

    .project-header {
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .section-label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--primary);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.65rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    /* Grade do Projeto */
    .project-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    @media (min-width: 640px) {
      h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
      }

      .project-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
    }

    .card {
      background-color: var(--surface-color);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }

    .card h3 {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-main);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .card h3::before {
      content: "";
      display: inline-block;
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      background-color: var(--primary);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .card p {
      font-size: 0.975rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    /* Rodapé */
    footer {
      background-color: var(--surface-color);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      padding: 36px 0;
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .footer-title {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-main);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .github-link {
      display: inline-block;
      color: var(--primary);
      background-color: var(--primary-light);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      transition: background-color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
      word-break: break-all;
    }

    .github-link:hover,
    .github-link:focus {
      background-color: #dbeafe;
      border-color: #bfdbfe;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="container">
      <span class="badge">Ciência de Dados</span>
      <h1>Renato Montagnoli Robles</h1>
      <p class="institution">Fatec Adamantina</p>
      <p class="bio">"Gosto de estar sempre com a minha familia."</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="project-header">
        <span class="section-label">Projeto</span>
        <h2>AuAtendente</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="project-grid">
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Problema</h3>
          <p>O principal era a alta demanda de mensagens no WhatsApp, para responder todos.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>O que eu fiz</h3>
          <p>Desenvolvemos um aplicativo que já direciona o departamento que a pessoa gostaria de falar.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Como eu fiz</h3>
          <p>Fizemos através do Visual Studio Code</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Resultado</h3>
          <p>Estamos na fase de Teste.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <p class="footer-title">Contatos</p>
      <a class="github-link" href="https://github.com/RoblesRenato" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        GitHub: https://github.com/RoblesRenato
      </a>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
